    "stem": "Bina learns Gumulgal number names: urapon means $1$ and ukasar means $2$. Longer names are built as sums of these group words, so ukasar-urapon means $3$ and ukasar-ukasar means $4$.\n\nWhich reading of ukasar-ukasar-ukasar is correct?",
